# Definition of done

An issue is done only when all of these hold:

- [ ] `cargo xtask ci` passes locally and CI is green on the PR.
- [ ] Coverage held: workspace >= 80%, `stillwatch-core` >= 90%.
- [ ] Every `.rs` file <= 400 lines excluding test modules; no `jscpd` clones.
- [ ] New behavior has tests.
- [ ] Docs updated. If settings changed, regenerate `docs/config.md`. If a design changed, update the Linear project document and the Decision log.
- [ ] A summary comment is on the Linear issue: what changed, decisions made, follow-ups (filed as new issues).

Don't report an issue as done with any box unchecked. Say which one is open and why.
